        {"zh": "我的力量渐渐消失。", "en": "My strength fades."},
        {"zh": "我只能等待机会。", "en": "I can only wait for an opportunity."},
        {"zh": "守护这片土地。", "en": "Guard this land."},
        {"zh": "等待，直到你出现。", "en": "Wait until you appear."},
        {"zh": "弓弦一直拉着，你迟早要出来。", "en": "My bowstring stays drawn, you must come out."},
        {"zh": "我的箭矢随时待命。", "en": "My arrows are always ready."},
        {"zh": "我的存在，就是为了对抗。", "en": "My existence is to fight."},
        {"zh": "我是不死的弓僵尸。", "en": "I am the undying bow zombie."},
        {"zh": "我的弓一直拉着，天还没黑。", "en": "My bow stays drawn, though the sun is up."}
      ]
    },
